  "html": "<table cellpadding=\"5\" style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left; max-width: 300px;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#CC0033; color:#FFFFFF;\"> TheCenturions\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"> <a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Guild-_TheCenturions.jpg\" title=\"Image:Guild-_TheCenturions.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Guild-_TheCenturions.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"201\" src=\"/images/Guild-_TheCenturions.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Leader\n</th><td> <a href=\"/wiki/User:Catwalksbyhimself\" title=\"User:Catwalksbyhimself\">CatWalksByHimself</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Officers\n</th><td> MysticSymbol\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> No. of members\n</th><td> 9 and growing!\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> VoIP\n</th><td> No\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Language\n</th><td> Primarily English\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> IRC channel\n</th><td> N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Time zone\n</th><td> Primarily USA\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Guild_Overview\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Guild Overview </span></h2>\n<p>TheCenturions is a guild for Level 100s, and Levels 90+. The main goal is to help the Level 90+ to reach that magic moment when Karl says, \"You Win!\"  (and maybe streak Townston to celebrate!)  Members should be helpful people who like to have something useful to do after reaching L100.  To join, PM any of us online, drop a note to <a href=\"/wiki/User:Catwalksbyhimself\" title=\"User:Catwalksbyhimself\">User:catwalksbyhimself</a> or email Cat@thetownstons.com.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Members\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Members </span></h2>\n<p>Since everybody reached L100, TheCenturions are currently inactive.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Latest_News\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Latest News </span></h2>\n<p>Guild started Oct 28 2008\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Manglefeet_pwned.jpg\" title=\"Manglefeet pwned.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"195\" src=\"/images/Manglefeet_pwned.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/><b>Oct 29 -- Mystic Symbol and Cat PWNed Manglefeet</b>\n</td><td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Mystic100.jpg\" title=\"Mystic100.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"222\" src=\"/images/Mystic100.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/><b>Oct 30 -- TheCenturions streak Townston to celebrate MysticSymbol's L100.</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nov 1 -- evilpro reaches L100, but doesn't streak Townston   :-( </b>\n</td><td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Centurions_loot.jpg\" title=\"Centurions loot.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"153\" src=\"/images/Centurions_loot.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/><b>Nov 3 -- ouchthatfreakinhurts and Cat pile up the loot in MMM!</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Mask.jpg\" title=\"Mask.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"267\" src=\"/images/Mask.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/><b>Nov 5 -- When the Wishing Well gave Cat a wrestler's mask, posse member Mystic Symbol had first chance at making a deal for it.</b>\n</td><td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Ablaster_streak.jpg\" title=\"Ablaster streak.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"261\" src=\"/images/Ablaster_streak.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/><b>Nov 10 -- Ablaster reaches Level 100 with lots of growth items, and streaks Townston with TheCenturions to celebrate!!</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/HDOL_posse.jpg\" title=\"HDOL posse.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"173\" src=\"/images/HDOL_posse.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/><b>Nov 2 -- Posse run in HDoL.  Hoffarth and mauiboy gaining xp towards L100 with help from Cat.</b>\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
